>variable called time, but I haven't figured out the right loader
>flags or something - I never get a value other than 0.

For the current pid, just use

#include <sys/user.h>

.
.
.

pid_t pid;

pid = u.u_procp->p_pid;

For the time, the approach should be:

#include <sys/time.h>

struct timeval tv;

microtime(&tv);

