> This indeed seems to do what I need, since after adding this to
> sendmail.cf, even mail to a username in all lower case will correctly
> find its way to the mixed case name.

    This creates its own set of problems, since you're now doing "fuzzy"
matching on the GECOS field.  Sooner or later, this *will* cause your
system to send mail intended for one user to someone else, whereas before
you would have bounced the message and the sender would at least have had
the chance to get the name spelled correctly.

